                                                "sense_id": "6a759a5f-d26e-35dd-8dc7-368477446468",
                                                "text": "Their king, Xerxes (Rodrigo Santoro), an epicene seven-footer with a shaved head and what looks like a gold-lamé thong, lounges on cushions in his court, surrounded by aroused lesbians intertwined and writhing like snakes in a basket."
